[{"id":4025791951,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7v9LXP","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I can confirm that this fixes the crash. \n\nHowever replacing `base->fully_qualified_name` with `base_root->fully_qualified_name` in this context is not correct. In the case of inner classes, `base_root` is the outer script, while `base` would be the inner. You should save the fully qualified name before the `find_class` call and use it in the error message.\n\n(I will say that this is a pretty theoretical remark, since I can't actually get the issue to trigger. Inner classes will already fail in `_gdtype_from_datatype` for the setup from the issue so they never reach the code touched here.)","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117932#pullrequestreview-4025791951","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117932","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godot